# app|process name (pgrep -x). dotfiles-apps restore refuses while any of
# these run. Every allowlisted app needs at least one line (check enforces it).
# `app|-` is only for CLI-only apps (aws-settings, fish, mkcert, ngrok,
# opencode, quicklook, zoxide); a GUI app needs its real process name.
adobe-camera-raw|Adobe Photoshop 2025
apple-music|Music
